  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pad krapow moo serves 2 and takes about 15 minutes. It is one of the quickest dinners in Thai cooking. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thai basil",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "thai-basil"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " goes in right at the end so it wilts gently rather than burning. Serve with jasmine rice and a fried egg on top for the full street food version."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not substitute Italian basil. Thai basil has a distinct peppery, slightly anise character that sweet basil cannot replicate."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
